# What `tilolang layout-check` finds in the shipped apps today, one finding id per line: these
# are known and do not fail `tests/layout_check.rs`; a finding not named here does. Take a line
# out once its problem is fixed (the test says when one no longer shows).
#
# The apps' own views.
overflow mail › conversation › std.page [Stack]

# At display scale 2 the detail column of a window with a draft open reaches past the window.
scrolls-sideways mail › mailboxes › ui.NavShell [Scrollable]

# A word longer than the window is wide (an address in a proposal) is clipped rather than
# broken.
clipped-text mail › compose › text [Text]

# A document header's toggle made after a press on a touchscreen keeps its pointer height.
small-hit-target mail › editor › std.document [Button]
small-hit-target notes › note_editor › std.document [Button]

# A virtual list among a section's other content is laid out taller than the section gives it.
overflow tasks › task_page › ui.TextInput [TextInput]
overflow tasks › task_page › ui.VirtualList [DescribedList]

# A grid's one column keeps its minimum width in a window narrower than it.
scrolls-sideways today › today › grid [Grid]
